<title>Lebanon: Lebanese CPI up 6.65 pct in 1996 - Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanese CPI up 6.65 pct in 1996 - Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanese consumer prices rose 6.65 percent in 1996, according to figures issued on Monday by the Lebanese Banks Association.</p>
<p>The Association issued the following figures for the</p>
<p>Consumer Price Index (Dec 1994 = 100):</p>
<p>		  Dec 95  Oct 96  Nov 96  Dec 96  Dec 95-Dec 96</p>
<p>								  %</p>
<p>		  111.24   121.58  119.73   118.64   6.65</p>
<p>Monthly Changes (%)</p>
<p>		   --	(1.16)  (1.52)    (0.91)   --</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057</p>
</text>
